cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DecisionSystems.jl"
abstract: >-
  Wraps a SciML ODEProblem or a ModelingToolkit System as a POMDPs.jl MDP or
  POMDP, so sampling-based planners run directly against the physics model,
  with the ODE solver executing inside every decision interval.
version: 0.1.0
